# Version 1.2.0 (versionCode 13) — update, not a first release

<en-US>
• Portfolio with profit/loss and trip budgets
• Alerts: percent change, quiet hours and an alert history
• Convert at a past date, saved pairs and a morning rate digest
• Voice input in the converter
• Top gainers and losers, currency strength, cross-rate matrix
• History: 5-day range, SMA 50/200 and CSV export
• Gold by purity, trend lines in the widget, backup and restore
</en-US>

